  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-69-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal safety of journalists in the Vinnytsia region</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Legal safety of journalists in the Vinnytsia region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Projekt je zameran&#xfd; na zaistenie nezamestnanosti a slobody v&#xfd;konu novin&#xe1;rskej pr&#xe1;ce najm&#xe4; novin&#xe1;rov zaoberaj&#xfa;cich sa spolo&#x10d;ensky a politicky citliv&#xfd;mi kauzami. S&#xfa;&#x10d;as&#x165;ou projektu je aj vydanie pr&#xed;ru&#x10d;ky o pr&#xe1;vnej ochrane a bezpe&#x10d;nosti investigat&#xed;vnych novin&#xe1;rov. &#x17d;iadate&#x13e; pl&#xe1;nuje zorganizova&#x165; 3 okr&#xfa;hle stoly pre novin&#xe1;rov, blogerov, z&#xe1;stupcov miestnych in&#x161;tit&#xfa;ci&#xed; vr&#xe1;tane pol&#xed;cie a org&#xe1;nov &#x10d;inn&#xfd;ch v trestnom konan&#xed;. &#x160;kolenia bud&#xfa; zameran&#xe9; na mo&#x17e;nosti ochrany osobnosti a v&#xfd;konu pr&#xe1;ce novin&#xe1;rov.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aimed at ensuring unemployment and freedom of journalistic work, especially for journalists dealing with socially and politically sensitive cases. The project also includes the publication of a handbook on legal protection and security for investigative journalists. The applicant plans to organise 3 round tables for journalists, bloggers, representatives of local institutions including police and law enforcement agencies. The trainings will focus on the possibilities to protect the personality and work performance of journalists.</narrative>
  </description>
